he description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob03re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Asking and Refusing Help", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use these phrases to make a request for help, or to decline simple requests for help.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally:</span> Could you tell me what my password is?<br><span class=\"strong\">Technician</span>: I'm sorry, I can't do that for security reasons.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Making a Request\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Refusing a Request\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Can you help me \u2026 ? <br><br>  Can you give me a hand ... ?<br><br>  Could you please \u2026 ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Unfortunately, I can't. <br><br>  I really wish I could, but I can't.  <br><br> Sorry, I can't ...\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "IT", "type": "name"}, {"content": "Information Technology; the department of a company responsible for computer systems", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Is this the IT department?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob03aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you talk about computers.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "client services ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " a resource that helps people use a company's computer systems", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: Hello, client services, how can I help you?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob03aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "department", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a section of a company responsible for one area", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: I'd like to speak to someone in the IT department.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob03aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to activate ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to start; to get going ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Did you activate your account?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob03aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "username ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the letters, numbers or symbols you use to log in to a computer system", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: I see that the username sdavid is activated. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob03aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "password ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a secret combination of letters, numbers and symbols used to enter a computer system", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Sorry, I must have the wrong password. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob03aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "network", "type": "name"}, {"content": " a series of things that are connected, like the computers in a company's IT system", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: I had problems logging on to the network.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob03aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to verify", "type": "name"}, {"content": " to make sure ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Could you please verify if my account is active?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob03aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Think of a problem you could have with a computer.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write your dialogue. Start the dialogue by phoning client services of a company.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Explain the problem.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Find a solution to the problem.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Practice your dialogue.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Change roles.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I write a dialogue of 6 - 10 lines.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I practice the dialogue.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I change roles.", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"id": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le17ob03re2aud01", "images": [{"image": "engenn5le17ob03re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "", "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn5le17ob03re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Technician</span>: Hello, client services, how can I help you?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Oh, is this the IT department?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Technician</span>:  Yes it is.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Hello, my name is Sally Davis. I'm a freelance journalist. I started working with Cambridge Life a few days ago.", "time": "4500"}, {"image": "engenn5le17ob03re2img01.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Technician</span>:  OK. How can I help you?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Well, I got a new e-mail address, but it's not always working. I had problems logging on to the network. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Technician</spa